  intent: 'comp-001 #1. One round: FILL 300 or ESCAPE. 60% of bounces clone, start gap
    24deg, +1.5deg per escape. Calibrated from run logs (escapes ~1/4 of the geometric
    rate at small gaps). Tune gapDegreesPerEscape only: FULL every time -> raise; EMPTY
    with peak under ~200 -> lower. Read the [mve] summary line after each run.'
